<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.30		 40.35</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	63.55		 63.65</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.30		 26.35</p>
<p>Japanese yen</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 8.70 pct	    8.90 pct</p>
</text>
